    {
      "chunk_id": "chunk_0003",
      "text": "This website contains materials for use by other instructors teaching a blended, flipped or online course where core concepts in neuroscience are being developed. The materials are licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license, so they can be modified with attribution to the authors.",
